libatrac9
------------------------------------------
Library for decoding audio in Sony's ATRAC9 format

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libatrac9-devel-0.0.3-1bl3
  libatrac9_0-0.0.3-1bl3
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/Thealexbarney/LibAtrac9

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/Thealexbarney/LibAtrac9/archive/refs/tags/v0.0.3.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libatrac9-0.0.3-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libatrac9-0.0.3-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libatrac9-0.0.3-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libatrac9-0.0.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libatrac9_0-0.0.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libatrac9-devel-0.0.3-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libatrac9)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libatrac9.README

(libatrac9_0)
  /usr/bin/cygatrac9-0.dll

(libatrac9-devel)
  /usr/include/libatrac9.h
  /usr/lib/libatrac9.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libatrac9.pc

------------------

